  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "cdadb933-2edc-439c-bd0f-d6093d6669cd",
    "name": "Practico DRF - Catalogo de Productos",
    "description": "Coleccion para probar el catalogo de productos (Django + DRF).\n\nFlujo sugerido:\n1) Correr 'Autenticacion JWT > 1. Login' con el usuario admin (o el que hayas creado con createsuperuser). El request ya trae un script que guarda 'access' y 'refresh' en las variables de coleccion access_token / refresh_token automaticamente.\n2) Correr el resto de las carpetas: las requests marcadas 'requiere auth' usan access_token solas (Bearer Token).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "0"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Autenticacion JWT",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Login - obtener tokens (POST)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/token/",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": [
                "127",
                "0",
                "0",
                "1"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "token"
              ],
              "port": "8000"
            },
            "description": "Login: guarda automaticamente 'access' y 'refresh' en las variables de coleccion access_token / refresh_token (ver pestana Tests) para que el resto de las requests protegidas los usen solas.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"admin\",\n  \"password\": \"admin12345\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', data.access);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', data.refresh);",
                  "    console.log('Tokens guardados en las variables de la coleccion.');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Refresh - renovar access token (POST)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/token/refresh/",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": [
                "127",
                "0",
                "0",
                "1"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "token",
                "refresh"
              ],
              "port": "8000"
            },
            "description": "",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refresh\": \"{{refresh_token}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', data.access);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "3. Verify - validar un token (POST)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/token/verify/",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": [
                "127",
                "0",
                "0",
                "1"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "token",
                "verify"
              ],
              "port": "8000"
            },
            "description": "",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"{{access_token}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
